<title>USA: TABLE - Castle Energy Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Castle Energy Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>RADNOR, Pa. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended June 30,</p>
<p>						    1997		1996</p>
<p>					   (unaudited)	(unaudited)</p>
<p> Revenues				 $15,265,000     $16,616,000</p>
<p> Net income				20,363,000	 1,816,000</p>
<p>Share earnings</p>
<p>   Net income				    3.72		 .27</p>
<p>   Average shares			 5,467,473	 6,729,769</p>
<p>					    Nine Months Ended June 30,</p>
<p>						     1997	     1996</p>
<p>					   (unaudited)	(unaudited)</p>
<p> Revenues				  59,068,000	57,082,000</p>
<p> Net income				25,509,000	12,444,000</p>
<p>Share earnings</p>
<p>   Net income				    4.19		1.85</p>
<p>   Average shares			 6,087,803	 6,717,879</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 results include non-recurring $19,667,000 gain realized from the sale of its Texas oil and gas properties and pipeline to Union Pacific Resources Co. on May 30, 1997.</p>
<p>1997 Q2 includes tax provision of $1,436,000, consisting of $767,000 for recurring operations and $669,000 for the non-recurring gain.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
